+- **Gemini Amharic/Tigrigna/Afaan Oromo quality** — client selected Gemini (Q45); Q39 lists 5 launch languages. Verify current Gemini multilingual support + free-tier limits.
+- **Chapa**: does it actually aggregate Telebirr and CBE Birr (spec C7's core justification)? Sandbox availability, webhook signature scheme, payout/transfer API for withdrawals. → flag as "needs user-provided docs" where the public web is thin.
+- **Gold/platinum price APIs** (GoldAPI, Metals-API, alternatives): free-tier rate limits vs a 30s tick worker, platinum support, USD→ETB rate source.
